k L86:     * cite67†Staff Directory L87:     * cite68†Job Opportunities L88:     * cite69†FAQ L89: cite70†Image L90: ## Frequently Asked Questions\nL91: \nL92: [Input]\nL93: \nL94: \nL95: \nL96: cite71†<< Home L97: \nL98: Select Category [Select] [Input: Type some keyword...]\nL99: # FAQ - Frequently Asked Question\nL100: \nL101: 1. How to apply job vacancy at the department?\nL102: \nL103: You can check and apply online at http://erecruitment.sarawak.gov.my\nL104: \nL105: 2. Procedure for Purchasing Maps/ Aerial Photographs\nL106: \nL107: RESTRICTED MAPS AND AERIAL PHOTOGRAPHS\nL108:    | Complete the any of the relevant application Form below and submit in triplicate supported by a copy of the applicant Identity card:\nL109: \nL110:    | (a)   Form PPNM-1            : to be filled by general public; or\nL111: (b)   Form PPNM-1A (81)  : to be filled by Government Departments\nL112:    | The application will be assigned with file a reference.\nL113:    | To indicate clearly whether the applicant is a foreigner /foreign-owned company or a Malaysian.\nL114:  | If applicant is a Malaysian, then application shall be submitted to the State Commissioner of Police, Kuching for approval.\nL115:    | If applicant is a foreigner or foreign-owned company, the application shall be submitted to the Inspector General of Police, Headquarters in Kuala Lumpur for approval.\nL116:    | The applicant will be informed of the outcome by letter.\nL117:    | Upon notification of approval, the applicant is required to come in person to make payment and for collection of maps/aerial photographs.\nL118:    | The payment will be acknowledged with official receipt and endorsement by the Department on the reverse side of the maps/aerial photographs.\nL119: \nL120: \nL121: * Only available at Cartography Section at Level 1 Land and Survey Department Headquarters, Menara Pelita, Petra Jaya, Kuching\nL122: \nL123: 3. What are the payment options for eLASIS services?\nL124: \nL125: There are 4 payment options available for eLASIS Users:\nL126: 1) Bank Account Direct Debit via Sarawak Government Official Secured Payment Gateway, Paybills Malaysia\nL127: 2) Credit Card via Sarawak Government Official Secured Payment Gateway, Paybills Malaysia\nL128: 3) Prepayment Account\nL129: 4) SPay Global (eWallet)\nL130: 4. What is the link for eLasis Services?\nL131: \nL132: Visit website cite72†https://elasis.sarawak.gov.my/†elasis.sarawak.gov.my L133: ### Useful Links\nL134: \nL135: Best view using Mozilla Firefox and Google Chrome with web view resolution 1920 x 1080. | © Copyright of the Land and Survey Department, Sarawak (JTS).\nL136: Copyright of this website and its contents but limited to the information, text, images, graphics, sound files, video files and their arrangement, and material therein, is owned by the owner of this website unless otherwise indicated. No part or parts of this website may be modified, copied, distributed, retransmitted, broadcasted, displayed, reproduced, published, licensed, transferred, sold or commercially dealt with in any manner without the express prior written consent of the owner of this website.\nL137: Last Updated On 14 Oct 2026\nL138: \nL139: Operating Hours\nL140: Monday - Thursday\nL141: 8:00am to 1:00pm & 2:00pm to 5:00pm\nL142: Friday\nL143: 8:00am to 11:45am & 2:15pm to 5:00pm\nL144: Saturday, Sunday & Public Holiday\nL145: Counter Closed\nL146: \nL147: Land and Survey Department Sarawak.\nL148: Ground Floor until Level 8, Menara Pelita,\nL149: Jalan Tun Abdul Rahman Yaakub,\nL150: 93050 Petra Jaya, Kuching,\nL151: Sarawak, Malaysia.\nL152: Telephone : 6082-374555\nL153: Fax : 6082-374582\nL154: Email: landsurvey@sarawak.gov.my\nL155: \nL156: [Input] Subscribe Newsletter [Input:  Your Email] [Input]\nL157: cite73†Sarawak Gov App†gamma.malaysia.gov.my L158: \nL159: cite74†Image: image cite75†Image: image L160: \nL161: cite76†Sitemap cite77†Complaint & Feedback cite78†Privacy Policy ci